  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.38 - GridSample border and reflection padding (PyTorch / ONNX semantics; they ran as zeros in 5.3.x, then threw): SpawnScene's RaCo-ALIKED keypoint sampling runs again, matching onnxruntime on CPU and WebGPU. Dependencies: SpawnJS 3.0.12 and SpawnJS.Blazor 3.0.12 (ML had pinned 3.0.8, so consumers never got 3.0.9-3.0.12), SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.55. Built with SDK 10 (global.json).",
